# 小屏, a finger, on the workspace of real size over a late core (src/sfbench/switch_scene.mbt): the workspaces' sheet
# opened by the switcher, then the other workspace's row pressed, measured from that press: the sheet closing as the
# switch is done.
timeout 20000
until 星火工作室
wait 1500
tap1 星火工作室
wait 700
log measure
tap 个人
wait 900
exit
